 "type": "training",
 "title": "《发这篇》十月训练总结｜行之有恒 久而成锋",
 "slots": [
  {
   "path": "0:col1/4:txt1",
   "plain": "北京交通大学国旗仪仗队",
   "occ": 2,
   "htmlLen": 149,
   "html": "<p style><span style=\"font-family: tn-font-family-default;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(202, 26, 24);\">北京交通大学国旗仪仗队</span></strong></span><br></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "0:col1/7:txt1",
   "plain": "行之有恒久而成锋",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 543,
   "html": "<p style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(206, 198, 173) 0%, rgb(147, 124, 71) 50%, rgb(251, 237, 190) 100%); color: transparent;-webkit-background-clip: text;\"><span style=\"font-family: tn-font-family-default;\"><span style><strong>行之有恒</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(206, 198, 173) 0%, rgb(147, 124, 71) 50%, rgb(251, 237, 190) 100%); color: transparent;-webkit-background-clip: text;\"><span style=\"font-family: tn-font-family-default;\"><strong>久而成锋</strong></span><br></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "0:col1/8:col1/0:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "— 十月训练总结 —",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 61,
   "html": "<p><strong>—&nbsp;十月训练总结</strong><strong>&nbsp;—</strong></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "1:col1/1:txt1",
   "plain": "秋意渐浓，26中队预备队已在仪仗队度过了一个月的时光，25中队也接过接力棒，将逐步接手日常升旗任务。",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 107,
   "html": "<p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\"><span style>秋意渐浓，26中队预备队已在仪仗队度过了一个月的时光，25中队也接过接力棒，将逐步接手日常升旗任务</span>。</p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "2:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "3:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "4:col2/0:txt1",
   "plain": "26中队预备队风采",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 51,
   "html": "<p style><strong>&nbsp;26中队预备队风采&nbsp;</strong></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "01训练内容",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 192,
   "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 41.6667%;\"><strong><em>01训练内容&nbsp;</em></strong><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></span><strong><em>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/1:txt1",
   "plain": "本月，26中队预备队以夯实基础、锤炼纪律素养、塑造良好风貌为核心目标，有序开展集中训练。",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 236,
   "html": "<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\">本月，26中队预备队以夯实基础、锤炼纪律素养、塑造良好风貌为核心目标，有序开展集中训练。</span></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/4:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/5:txt1",
   "plain": "训练聚焦基础核心动作，练习稍息、军姿、转体、齐步走摆臂、敬礼礼毕、端腿等基础科目，为后续训练打下基础。",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 89,
   "html": "<p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\">训练聚焦基础核心动作，练习稍息、军姿、转体、齐步走摆臂、敬礼礼毕、端腿等基础科目，为后续训练打下基础。</p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/7:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 11,
   "html": "<p><br></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/8:txt1",
   "plain": "02训练成果",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 243,
   "html": "<p><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\"><em><br></em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\"><em>02训练成果</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\"><em><br></em></strong></p><p><br></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/9:txt1",
   "plain": "训练初期，存在动作不标准、肢体协调性欠缺、队列整齐度差等问题。面对训练中的短板与不足，全体预备队员反复打磨、练习，逐步攻克难点。",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 228,
   "html": "<p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\">训练初期，存在动作不标准、肢体协调性欠缺、队列整齐度差等问题。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.6px;\">面对训练中的短板与不足，全体预备队员反复打磨、练习，逐步攻克难点。</span></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "5:col1/10:col3/0:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
