   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "8:col2/0:txt1",
   "plain": "25中队风采",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 69,
   "html": "<p style><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; 25中队风采&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/1:col1/0:col2/0:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "训练内容",
   "occ": 2,
   "htmlLen": 65,
   "html": "<p style><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 1.8px;\">训练内容</strong></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/2:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/4:txt1",
   "plain": "十月以来，25中队坚持每周常态化晚训。训练聚焦各项专业能力。",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 135,
   "html": "<p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 2.2133em; letter-spacing: 1.6px;\">十月以来，25中队坚持每周常态化晚训。训练聚焦各项专业能力。</span></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/6:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/7:col1/0:col2/0:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "训练成果",
   "occ": 2,
   "htmlLen": 65,
   "html": "<p style><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 1.8px;\">训练成果</strong></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/8:txt1",
   "plain": "针对训练短板，队员们主动精进，在带队骨干的指导下逐一纠正偏差，全力磨合队列默契。",
   "occ": 1,
   "htmlLen": 78,
   "html": "<p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\">针对训练短板，队员们主动精进，在带队骨干的指导下逐一纠正偏差，全力磨合队列默契。</p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "9:col1/10:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "10:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 13,
   "html": "<p><br /></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "11:txt1",
   "plain": "",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 11,
   "html": "<p><br></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "12:col2/0:txt1",
   "plain": "总   结",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 99,
   "html": "<p style><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;总&nbsp; &nbsp;结&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>"
  },
  {
   "path": "13:col1/1:col1/0:txt1",
   "plain": "回望十月，全体队员以饱满热情投入训练。队员们的队列素养、动作标准度、团队默契均得到显著提升。希望全体队员继续保持良好的训练态度，在后续的训练中精益求精，续写仪仗队的青春荣光。",
   "occ": 0,
   "htmlLen": 163,
   "html": "<p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\">回望十月，全体队员以饱满热情投入训练。队员们的队列素养、动作标准度、团队默契均得到显著提升。</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em;\">希望全体队员继续保持良好的训练态度，在后续的训练中精益求精，续写仪仗队的青春荣光。</p>"
  },
